# Use subagents (Nebula)

When work matches, **Task-delegate** instead of doing everything in the parent:

| Situation | Subagent |
|-----------|----------|
| Finishing / "done" / DoD / gate | `nebula-gate` |
| Toast / capsule / tokens / WebView UI claims | `nebula-ui-auditor` |
| Handoff inbox / outbox / `t0NN` | `handoff-inbox` |
| Skeptical verify after any claim | `verifier` (user) |
| Races, hangs, silent crashes, flaky bugs | `debugger` (user) |
| Run / fix automated tests | `test-runner` (user) |
| Branch/PR review before merge | `pr-reviewer` (user) |

Parent keeps orchestration and user talk. Subagents gather evidence and report.
Do not rubber-stamp a subagent - if gate fails, fix then re-run.